    "created_at": "2020-03-21T12:30:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-21T12:30:36Z",
    "body": "We should get `capture` into the HTML standard itself. In general, all elements and attributes for the HTML language should be available in the HTML standard itself, even if some or all of the associated requirements for the element or attribute are defined in a separate spec, with the HTML standard referencing that spec.\r\n\r\nSo let’s please work together on getting `capture` included in HTML. cc @xfq ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
